{"4760350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eyeball Alley", "steam_appid": 4760350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an eyeball. Everything is an eyeball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eyeball Alley is a trippy marble-rolling game with no fixed up. Gravity follows the surface beneath you as you roll across worlds that curve in every direction, from tiny planets to twisting tunnels to knots and gyroids. Follow the gold waves to the golden eyeballs. Dig tunnels through anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roaming eyeballs hurt. Each hit leaves you a shade redder, and the third one kills you. Green eyeballs heal you. Knock over pins for bonus points, and the faster you finish, the more you score.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an eyeball. Everything is an eyeball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eyeball Alley is a trippy marble-rolling game with no fixed up. Gravity follows the surface beneath you as you roll across worlds that curve in every direction, from tiny planets to twisting tunnels to knots and gyroids. Follow the gold waves to the golden eyeballs. Dig tunnels through anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roaming eyeballs hurt. Each hit leaves you a shade redder, and the third one kills you. Green eyeballs heal you. Knock over pins for bonus points, and the faster you finish, the more you score.</p>", "short_description": "You are an eyeball, and everything is an eyeball. Roll through trippy worlds where gravity follows every curve of the surface beneath you. Roaming eyeballs knock you off course, and the third hit kills you. Dig tunnels through anything.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760350/00bc2401760f71bea65a2ebb1bd8bb66d5789d3b/header.jpg?t=1788022421", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse